    "law_text": "These GTCU are governed and interpreted in accordance with the **Law of the Republic of Niger**.",
    "jurisdiction": "Any dispute relating to the interpretation or execution of these GTCU that cannot be settled amicably shall be submitted to the exclusive jurisdiction of the **Competent Courts of Niamey**.",
    "contact_desc": "For any legal questions or complaints:"
